<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS3" title="In Appendix F Discussion ‣ Bias in Gender Bias Benchmarks: How Spurious Features Distort Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.3 </span>Limitations</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
