<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Bias in Gender Bias Benchmarks: 
<br class="ltx_break">How Spurious Features Distort Evaluation
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
